{"description":"When one of the app files is edited, check that the README feature list and run instructions still describe the app accurately, and update them if a feature, file, or control changed.","name":"Update README when app files change","then":{"prompt":"An app file (index.html, styles.css, or app.js) just changed. Compare the app's current features, screens, and controls against the 'Features' and 'How to run' sections of README.md. If anything drifted — a feature added/removed, a menu item renamed, a control changed — update README.md to match. If everything still matches, do nothing. Do not change the 'Built with Kiro' section unless the .kiro specs, steering, or hooks actually changed.","type":"askAgent"},"version":"1.0","when":{"patterns":["index.html","styles.css","app.js"],"type":"fileEdited"}}